    VALUES ('Best of 2024: Robot Dreams', 'Saturday, August 24 at 4 PM “Who needs humans? This is visual storytelling at its finest, a traditional animation of gentle, unshowy genius. Sometimes the very best love stories go deeper than words can say.” — Helen O''Hara, Empire Magazine KPAC presents ROBOT DREAMS as part of our Best of 2024 weekend featuring some of the best films of the year! The adventures and misfortunes of Dog and Robot in New York City during the 1980s. Heartwarming and heartbreaking in equal measure and gorgeously animated, Robot Dreams is the stuff great animation is made of. Rated: Not Rated | 1 hr 43 min | Tickets: $8 Adult / $5 Child / Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/RobotDreams_KeyArt-web.jpg', 103, 'N', true)
