    VALUES ('Blue Velvet', 'Sunday, January 26 at 7 PM “The seamless blending of beauty and horror is remarkable, the terror very real, and the sheer wealth of imagination virtually unequalled in recent cinema.” — Geoff Andrew, Time Out A tribute to David Lynch (1946-2025). KPAC presents the visionary and one-of-a-kind BLUE VELVET . The discovery of a severed human ear in a field leads a young man on an investigation tied to a beautiful, mysterious nightclub singer and a group of psychopathic criminals who have kidnapped her child. A subversive, surreal shocker that will leave the audience with a deeper appreciation for the potential of film storytelling. A must-see on the big screen for any cinephile. Rated: R | 2 hr | Tickets: $8 Adult / Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/poster-120-204x300.jpg', 90, 'R', true)
