    VALUES ('Carnival of Souls with Live Score', 'Sunday, April 7 at 7 PM KPAC presents a special screening of CARNIVAL OF SOULS featuring a score by FULLER, performed live to picture by Plaid Raptor! Made by industrial filmmakers on a small budget, the eerily effective B-movie classic Carnival of Souls was intended to have “the look of a Bergman and the feel of a Cocteau,” and with its strikingly used locations, it succeeds. This is a one-of-a-kind event where you can experience the cult classic film with a new score performed live! The screening is also the album release for SaltAir, from Plaid Raptor. Stick around after the screening for a set of songs from the band! Rated: Approved | 1 hr 18 min | Tickets: $10 General Admission', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/CoS-Poster-Final_27x41_print-web-199x300.jpg', 78, 'A', true)
