    VALUES ('Family Flicks: Toy Story 2', 'Wednesday, January 3 at 1 & 4 PM "They''ve done it again. The folks who brought you Toy Story now present Toy Story 2, another clever, riotous tale of life in the toy lane." — Malcolm Ritter, Associated Press KPAC is thrilled to present an entire week of TOY STORY for you and your family to enjoy during the holidays! Don''t miss this opportunity to experience the entire series on the big screen! When Woody is stolen by a toy collector, Buzz and his friends set out on a rescue mission to save Woody before he becomes a museum toy property. The rare sequel that arguably improves on its predecessor, TOY STORY 2 uses inventive storytelling, gorgeous animation, and a talented cast to deliver another rich moviegoing experience for all ages. Rated: G | 1 hr 32 min | Tickets: $8 Adult or $5 Child or Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/poster-77-200x300.jpg', 92, 'G', true)
