    VALUES ('Interview with the Vampire', 'Saturday, October 12 at 7 PM “Horribly exciting, shocking and funny.” — Peter Bradshaw, Guardian KPAC presents a 30th Anniversary screening of INTERVIEW WITH THE VAMPIRE . In late 20th-century San Francisco, a 200-year-old vampire tells his story-of desire, love, yearning, grief, terror, ecstasy-to a young reporter, weaving the history that has come to be known as Interview With The Vampire. This sumptuous adaptation of the Anne Rice best-selling novel of the same name boasts a superstar cast of Tom Cruise, Brad Pitt, Antonio Banderas, Stephen Rea, Christian Slater, and Kirsten Dunst. Interview with a Vampire benefits from Neil Jordan’s atmospheric direction and an abundance of gothic thrills. Rated: R | 2 hr 3 min | Tickets: $8 Adult / Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/InterviewWithVamp_V_DD_KA_TT_2000x3000_300dpi_EN_77aa44ef-copy.jpg', 123, 'R', true)
