    VALUES ('Monty Python and the Holy Grail', 'Sunday, December 3 at 7:00 PM Monday, December 4 at 7:00 PM (Quote-Along) “A wonderful charm filters through these almost collegiate efforts, as if these underfunded Brits, in doing their best, did it better.” — Slant Magazine Join us and a host of Monty Python fans (new & old, and not-so-old) to celebrate the 48 1/2 anniversary of MONTY PYTHON AND THE HOLY GRAIL , back in theaters for a short time! With an all-new quote-along, created exclusively for this anniversary release, audiences will enjoy an interactive and uproarious cinematic experience in a way that only Monty Python can delivery. Get ready to go on a Medieval quest with coconut-clacking horses and unforgettable one-liners, that will have you shouting “Bring out your dead”, singing along as a Knight of the Round Table - and loving every [91 minutes] of it. The screening on Sunday will feature the standard theatrical version of the film, while the Monday showing will present a special quote-along version crafted exclusively for this event! Rated: PG | 1 hr 31 min | Tickets: $8 Adult or $5 Child or Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/Copy-of-MP_HOLYGRAIL_1080x1600_C1-203x300.jpg', 91, 'PG', true)
