    VALUES ('Moscow Film Society: Aliens', 'Tuesday, April 4 at 7 PM "Scene to scene, encounter to encounter, its tension builds unrelentingly. So, fasten your seat belts. It`s a blast." — Chicago Tribune April marks the 1-Year Anniversary of Moscow Film Society! It all started with a screening of ALIEN so in celebration we are having a free screening of ALIENS ! Decades after surviving the Nostromo incident, Ellen Ripley is sent out to re-establish contact with a terraforming colony, but finds herself battling the Alien Queen and her offspring. ALIENS packs a visceral punch of thrills and features one of the best action performances of all time from Sigourney Weaver. Sponsored by Pour Company, Ted Curet (Allstate Insurance), and Hodgins Drug and Hobby. Rated: R | 2 hr 17 min | Tickets: Free', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/ALIENS-free-198x300.png', 137, 'R', true)
