    VALUES ('National Theatre Live: Dr. Strangelove', 'Saturday, April 19 at 1 PM "A masterful recreation of sublime comic acting " — Broadway World KPAC presents the National Theatre Live production of DR. STRANGELOVE . Seven-time BAFTA Award-winner Steve Coogan plays four roles in the world premiere stage adaptation of Stanley Kubrick’s comedy masterpiece Dr. Strangelove. When a rogue U.S General triggers a nuclear attack, a surreal race takes place, seeing the Government and one eccentric scientist scramble to avert global destruction. This explosively funny satire is led by a world-renowned creative team led including Emmy Award-winner Armando Iannucci (Veep) and Olivier Award-winner Sean Foley. Rated: PG-13 | 2 hr 10 min | Tickets: $10 General Admission / No Film Passes', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/NTL-2025-Dr.-Strangelove-Listing-Image-874x1240px-Portrait-212x300.jpg', 130, 'PG-13', true)
