    VALUES ('Sound on Screen: A Hard Day&#8217;s Night', 'Thursday, June 22 at 7:00 PM “As invigorating and funny now as it was on its original release half a century ago, A Hard Day''s Night offers both a perfect showcase for the Beatles and an intriguing snapshot of fast-changing, early-1960s British society. ” — Independent (UK) KPAC presents A HARD DAY''S NIGHT as part of our new Sound on Screen series featuring films all about music! Over two "typical" days in the life of The Beatles, the boys struggle to keep themselves and Sir Paul McCartney''s mischievous grandfather in check while preparing for a live TV performance. After all these years A HARD DAY''S NIGHT is still a delight to watch. Using an ingenious mockumentary style it showcases everything you love about The Beatles and still really rocks. Watch it on the big screen with big sound (we are turning this one up)! Rated: G | 1 hr 27 min | Tickets: $7 Adult or $3 Child or Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/poster-58-200x300.jpg', 87, 'G', true)
