    VALUES ('Strange Journey: The Story of Rocky Horror', 'Sunday, October 5 at 7 PM “Lively and engagingboth an insightful chronicle of Rocky Horror’s origins and legacy as well as a heartfelt tribute to its fans that explores its enduring appeal.” — James Kleinmann, The Queer Review KPAC and Sirius Entertainment present STRANGE JOURNEY: THE STORY OF ROCKY HORROR . From its humble origins as a London fringe theater play, the documentary tracks its meteoric rise, fall and resurrection to become the biggest cult film of all time. With intimate access to its creator Richard O’Brien and other major players such as Tim Curry, Susan Sarandon and Lou Adler, the documentary explores what makes the play and film so singular: Its groundbreaking and transgressive themes, iconic performances and epic songs that took over popular culture. Sponsored by Sirius Entertainment. After the screening, stick around for a panel discussion featuring Moscow’s very own Rocky Horror Shadowcast! Rated: Not Rated | 1 hr 29 min | Tickets: $8 Adult / Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/StrangeJourney_27x39-vertical-poster_RED-web-208x300.jpg', 89, 'N', true)
