    VALUES ('The Palouse Doula Collective: No One Told Me', 'Saturday, May 13 at 1:00 PM NO ONE TOLD ME provides a raw and honest look at the postpartum period, a unique time in a woman''s life that is rarely captured in documentary film. The purely observational footage of incredibly intimate moments shows the highs and lows encountered by parents Elise and Marc as they adapt to life with a baby. Focusing on the new mother, the film shares the physical, hormonal and psychological changes she faces during the first 10 weeks of motherhood. Support for the event provided by The Palouse Doula Collective. The screening will be followed by a panel conversation about postpartum care. The panel will be moderated by Brittany Johnston, Postpartum Doula at Mother Nourish Postpartum. Panel members are: Lisa Malcolm LICSW, PMH-C Nancy Drazin LM, CPM Jessica Smith LPN, IBCLC ViviAnne Fischer LM, CPM Rated: Not Rated | 58 min | Tickets: $15', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/No-One-Told-Me-Flyer-209x300.png', 90, 'N', true)
