    VALUES ('Val Kilmer Tribute: Batman Forever', 'Thursday, May 8 at 7 PM “Burton went over the edge. Schumacher goes over the top. Result? Bigger, battier and better.” — Susan Wloszcyna, USA Today KPAC presents BATMAN FOREVER as part of our Tribute series celebrating those who have recently left us. Batman must battle former district attorney Harvey Dent, who is now Two-Face and The Riddler with help from an amorous psychologist and a young circus acrobat who becomes his sidekick, Robin. The flamboyance of Jim Carey and Tommy Lee Jones is grounded by Val Kilmer''s nuanced, witty and introspective Batman. The film is a nostalgic blast, reminding us why we can''t get enough of the over-the-top, self-serious superhero movies of the ''90s! Rated: PG-13 | 2 hr 1 min | Tickets: $8 Adult / $5 Child / Film Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/BatmanForever_V_DD_KA_TT_2000x3000_300dpi_EN_797088ee-copy-200x300.jpg', 121, 'PG-13', true)
