SELECT 'APOD Productions: A Theatre Showcase', 'Saturday, January 20 at 1 PM APOD Productions is proud to present A THEATRE SHOWCASE that will feature The Emperor’s New Clothes, a captivating one-act play. Additionally, the showcase will include vibrant music and dance performances. The event will highlight the talent of our Theatre Workshop students, the Youth Choir, and other APOD performers. Mark your calendars for January 20th at 1 pm at the Kenworthy Performing Arts Centre. Tickets will be available at the door, priced at $15 for General Admission and $5 for kids ages 6-12. Tickets: $15 General Admission or $5 Kids', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/Final_APOD-Emperors-New-Clothes-666x1024-1-195x300.jpg', 'ticketed', true
