SELECT 'Blaine Andrew Ross &#038; the Contraband Cowboys + Will Fontaine Band', 'Friday, August 16 Doors at 7 PM KPAC presents a night of live music featuring BLAINE ANDREW ROSS & THE CONTRBAND COWBOYS with WILL FONTAINE BAND. Blaine Ross is a Pacific Northwest-based singer, songwriter, saxophonist and guitarist. Will Fontaine’s Folk Rock sound combines danceable rhythms and addictive melodies. New album In Our Own Time available now. Tickets: $15 General Admission / $10 Online', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/Blaine-and-Will-web.jpg', 'ticketed', true
