SELECT 'Madeline Hawthorne', 'Wednesday, March 5 at 7:15 PM Get ready for an unforgettable night of music! KPAC proudly presents Madeline Hawthorne , the singer, songwriter, and multi-instrumentalist whose soul-stirring melodies and raw storytelling will captivate your heart. Kicking off the night with high-energy rock and electric stage presence is The Redline Syndicate , a local favorite known for their great live performances! Doors open at 6:30 PM. Tickets: $15 General Admission', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/madeline-hawthorne-27x41-1-198x300.png', 'ticketed', true
