SELECT 'Rendezvous Kick-off Show', 'Thursday, July 16 at 7 PM Before you mosey on down to Rendezvous in the Park on Friday and Saturday, come join us at the Backstage on July 16th for the RENDEZVOUS KICK-OFF SHOW ! Doors open at 6:30 pm and the show starts at 7:00 pm. The show will feature all local acts, so please join us for rubbery, hungover psych rock from Bill Tracy, reckless folk rock from Ravish, and readings from the Pop Up Prose crew, who have put together an irreverent, itinerant, queer-hearted creative writing reading series in Moscow since 2016. Rendezvous ticket holders get in for free! Tickets: $10 General Admission / Rendezvous in the Park Pass', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/flyer-web-232x300.jpg', 'ticketed', true
