SELECT 'The Bee Gees Tribute: You Should Be Dancing', 'Friday, May 22 at 7:30 PM Kenworthy Performing Arts Centre welcomes You Should Be Dancing – A Tribute to the Bee Gees on Friday, May 22, 2026. Recognized as the most explosive Bee Gees tribute experience in North America, You Should Be Dancing (YSBD) delivers the iconic sound, energy, and style of the legendary group while elevating the performance with dynamic visuals and undeniable charisma onstage. Audiences will dance and sing along to classics including “Stayin’ Alive,” “You Should Be Dancing,” “More Than a Woman,” “Night Fever,” and “How Deep Is Your Love,” plus songs written by the Bee Gees for Andy Gibb, Dolly Parton & Kenny Rogers, Frankie Valli, Barbra Streisand, and more. What are you waiting for?! YOU should be dancing!!! Tickets: $50 General Admission', 'https://www.kenworthy.org/wp-content/uploads/Untitled-design-200x300.jpg', 'ticketed', true
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.events WHERE title = 'The Bee Gees Tribute: You Should Be Dancing');

